.am/destination/erebuni-fortress-arin-berd/]; An inscription found at Arin Berd is dedicated to the founding of the fortress [SUPPORTED: https://www.urartianmonuments.com/arinberd/]; The inscription was carved during Argishti''s reign [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erebuni_Fortress]; The inscription was found in 1950 [SUPPORTED: https://visityerevan.am/uobjects/details/110/en/]"}]'::jsonb),
