}], "attribution": {"url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yelland_Stone_Rows&oldid=1364723862", "title": "Yelland Stone Rows", "changes": "sentences selected and shortened", "licence_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}, "desc_sha256": "a7176391acd06e1601c675a525a36f30bb3a65dea3313253f6b3d96925b8622d"}}', 'teaser-prov-s007-rollback:2d61ebea-06e2-4163-b610-a1a5187ed6d6:raw_data', 'rollback of teaser-prov-s007: raw_data ''{"description_citations": [{"n": 1, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yelland_Stone_Rows&oldid=1364723862", "title": "Wikipedia: Yelland Stone Rows", "domain": "en.wikipedia.org", "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"}], "_description_provenance": {"v": 1, "ai": "selected", "run": "v3-2026-09-26", "card": null, "lane": "W", "licence": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "sources": [{"id": "W", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yelland_Stone_Rows&oldid=1364723862", "revid": 1364723862, "licence": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "text_sha256": "9f3ca2ec9cacea359bd13b4367cd8c8ca26d5c4e2217569d511624842b83bca9", "rev_timestamp": "2026-07-18T04:04:39Z"}], "ai_system": "Claude Opus (Anthropic): anthropic/claude-opus-5-5 (Claude Code agent), an-sites-remediation-2026-09", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "end": 169, "src": "W", "drop": [[159, 168]], "start": 0}, {"n": 1, "end": 812, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 656}, {"n": 1, "end": 1312, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1230}, {"n": 1, "end": 1394, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1313}, {"n": 1, "end": 1554, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1395}, {"n": 1, "end": 1680, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1555}, {"n": 1, "end": 1811, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1682}], "attribution": {"url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yelland_Stone_Rows&oldid=1364723862", "title": "Yelland Stone Rows", "changes": "sentences selected and shortened", "licence_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}, "desc_sha256": "a7176391acd06e1601c675a525a36f30bb3a65dea3313253f6b3d96925b8622d"}}'' restored on Yelland Stone Rows', 'a7176391acd06e1601c675a525a36f30bb3a65dea3313253f6b3d96925b8622d', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-04: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-04-write-005", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-04/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "On the tidal mudflats of the River Taw, the Yelland Stone Rows ran in parallel pairs for 56m. By 1983 only seven stones showed above the mud, and the rest then disappeared from view."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-04: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-04-check-005 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-04/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "on the tidal mudflats of the River Taw [S1]; the stones run in parallel pairs [S1, S4]; the rows were 56 m long [S6]; by 1983 only seven stones were visible above the mud [S7]; the rest disappeared from view in the following years [S7]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-04: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-04-verify-015 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-04/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "The Yelland Stone Rows are a prehistoric stone alignment (double stone row) on the tidal mudflats of the River Taw estuary in Devon, England (central claim). [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yelland_Stone_Rows]; The stones ran in parallel pairs (two parallel rows, stones arranged in pairs). [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yelland_Stone_Rows]; The rows were 56 m long (as determined at their discovery in 1932; other surveys, e.g. Stone Rows of Great Britain, give 34.5 m for the surviving double row). [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yelland_Stone_Rows]; By 1983 only seven stones were visible above the mud. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yelland_Stone_Rows]; The remaining stones then disappeared from view (buried in silt). [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yelland_Stone_Rows]"}]'::jsonb),
